        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9214, Ridged Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional cabinet pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware. RK International's CK-9214 Beveled Cabinet Knob has a classic shape brought to life by the flow of the knob's ridges; but its true beauty lies in the array of finishes. In total, the ridged cabinet knob is available in 10 different finishes, including two toned and solid varieties. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9214 Step Up Beauty Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
